{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1775239288,"nonce":"j4UfpQ81dQcIWg6wQ0DNuIfuJVg=","title":"Add CODEX_MODEL, CODEX_BASE_URL, CODEX_API_KEY env vars for independent Codex provider config.","message":"Codex provider config is tangled with OVERFLOW_* vars. Need independent config so Codex can use OpenAI (default), OpenRouter, or local inference regardless of overflow state.\n\n\nEnv var fallback chain:\n```\nCODEX_API_KEY  → OPENAI_API_KEY → (fail)\nCODEX_BASE_URL → (none = OpenAI default, no config.toml needed)\nCODEX_MODEL    → (default: o3 for OpenAI, or set per provider)\n```\n\nEntrypoint logic:\n- If CODEX_BASE_URL set → generate ~/.codex/config.toml with custom provider\n- If CODEX_BASE_URL not set → just export OPENAI_API_KEY from CODEX_API_KEY, Codex uses OpenAI natively\n\nExample .env configurations:\n```bash\nCODEX_API_KEY=sk-openai-...\n\nCODEX_API_KEY=sk-or-...\nCODEX_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\nCODEX_MODEL=qwen/qwen3-coder\n\nCODEX_API_KEY=not-needed\nCODEX_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/v1\nCODEX_MODEL=local-model\n```\n\n- tests/test_entrypoint_codex_config.py::test_codex_api_key_only_no_config_toml\n  Assert: with CODEX_API_KEY but no CODEX_BASE_URL, no config.toml generated, OPENAI_API_KEY exported\n- tests/test_entrypoint_codex_config.py::test_codex_base_url_generates_config\n  Assert: with CODEX_BASE_URL set, config.toml generated with custom provider\n- tests/test_entrypoint_codex_config.py::test_codex_model_in_config\n  Assert: CODEX_MODEL appears in generated config.toml\n- tests/test_entrypoint_codex_config.py::test_codex_api_key_fallback_to_openai\n  Assert: without CODEX_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY is used\n- tests/test_overflow.py::test_codex_env_passthrough\n  Assert: CODEX_API_KEY, CODEX_BASE_URL, CODEX_MODEL in _PASSTHROUGH_ENV_VARS\n\n- docker-entrypoint.sh (modify — replace OVERFLOW_* fallback with CODEX_* vars)\n- host/docker_cmd.py (modify — add CODEX_API_KEY, CODEX_BASE_URL, CODEX_MODEL to _PASSTHROUGH_ENV_VARS)\n- tests/test_entrypoint_codex_config.py (modify — update tests for new env vars)\n\n1. In docker-entrypoint.sh, replace the codex config block:\n   - Check CODEX_API_KEY, fall back to OPENAI_API_KEY\n   - If CODEX_BASE_URL is set: generate config.toml with custom provider using CODEX_MODEL\n   - If CODEX_BASE_URL not set: just export OPENAI_API_KEY, no config.toml\n2. In host/docker_cmd.py, add CODEX_API_KEY, CODEX_BASE_URL, CODEX_MODEL to _PASSTHROUGH_ENV_VARS\n3. Update tests\n\nSee existing entrypoint codex config block and _PASSTHROUGH_ENV_VARS.\n\nREQ: REQ-033","files":null}]}